{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/services/layout,_N_T_/services/page,_N_T_/services"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/services/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/3007f7f21c751ce1d3a857893a846f210a2ff4d059056355a38b5c8a88136c3c/$/services","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/services/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2cxb684axw7o7.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3g4px251sg85e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2z-e6jheq0ftu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-03rfayxv7ep_b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3jnihsg-rcdh1.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Small Business Services in Jackson, MS | The Sip Web Studio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Explore website design, Google Business Profile optimization, local SEO, lead capture, business automation, AI, and monthly care with clear starting prices.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Small Business Services in Jackson, MS\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Explore website design, Google Business Profile optimization, local SEO, lead capture, business automation, AI, and monthly care with clear starting prices.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/services\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Sip Web Studio | Jackson, MS Web Design\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Practical websites and business technology for Mississippi businesses.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/social-card.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1xagt9q099n52.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/studio-icon.svg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"wrap nav\"><a class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"The Sip Web Studio home\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/services\">Services</a><a href=\"/#portfolio\">Work</a><a href=\"/#about\">About</a><a href=\"/#pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"/#contact\">Free growth review ↗</a></nav></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><section class=\"section wrap\"><div class=\"case-hero\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Small business technology · Jackson, Mississippi</p><h1>The right help.<br/><em>At the right stage.</em></h1><p class=\"lead\">Start with one practical improvement, or build a complete system. Find the service that fits your business today.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/#contact\">Get a free business growth review ↗</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/#pricing\">Compare core packages ↗</a></div></div><p class=\"service-intro\">Serving Jackson, Madison, Ridgeland, Brandon, Flowood, Pearl, and Clinton. Work directly with Wes on a defined scope and a clear price. One-time starting prices exclude third-party software, hosting, messaging, and usage unless your proposal includes them.</p><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"website-design\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Website design &amp; development</h2><p>Earn trust with a clear, fast website that makes your next customer’s decision easier.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$1,500+<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time project</p><h3><a href=\"/services/website-design\">Website Design &amp; Development</a></h3><p>Custom websites for Jackson, MS businesses that need to look credible, explain their services, and make it easy for customers to call or request an estimate.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/website-design\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$2,750+<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time project</p><h3><a href=\"/services/business-growth-system\">Business Growth System</a></h3><p>A website, local search foundation, and customer inquiry workflow for Mississippi service businesses ready to organize their next stage of growth.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/business-growth-system\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$4,500+<!-- --> · <!-- -->project starting price</p><h3><a href=\"/services/custom-business-systems\">Custom Business Systems</a></h3><p>Custom websites, applications, customer portals, and connected business systems for companies ready to move beyond standard tools.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/custom-business-systems\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"google-business-profile\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Google presence &amp; local SEO</h2><p>Help nearby customers understand what you do, where you work, and how to reach you.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$299<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time setup</p><h3><a href=\"/services/google-business-profile\">Google Business Profile Setup &amp; Optimization</a></h3><p>Google Business Profile setup or optimization for eligible Jackson-area businesses, with accurate details and a clear presentation of your services.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/google-business-profile\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$499<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time Local Visibility Boost</p><h3><a href=\"/services/local-seo\">Local SEO &amp; Visibility</a></h3><p>Local search improvements for small businesses in Jackson, Madison, Ridgeland, Brandon, Flowood, Pearl, and Clinton.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/local-seo\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"lead-capture\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Lead capture &amp; customer follow-up</h2><p>Give every inquiry a place to land and make the next step clear for your team.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$399<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time setup</p><h3><a href=\"/services/lead-capture\">Lead Capture &amp; Follow-Up Setup</a></h3><p>Estimate forms, lead logs, and inquiry acknowledgments for busy local service businesses that want a more organized response process.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/lead-capture\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$349<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time setup</p><h3><a href=\"/services/review-request-system\">Review Request System</a></h3><p>A simple review link, QR code, and approved follow-up workflow to help customers leave feedback after completed work.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/review-request-system\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"appointment-automation\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Business automation</h2><p>Connect bookings, customer records, and everyday tasks so you spend less time moving information around.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$499<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time setup</p><h3><a href=\"/services/appointment-automation\">Appointment &amp; Booking Automation</a></h3><p>Booking or appointment request integrations with confirmations and reminders for Mississippi businesses.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/appointment-automation\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">Custom quote<!-- --> · <!-- -->based on workflow and integrations</p><h3><a href=\"/services/business-automation\">Business Workflow Automation</a></h3><p>Practical workflows connecting forms, customer records, scheduling, and notifications for Jackson-area small businesses.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/business-automation\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"ai-solutions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Practical AI solutions</h2><p>Answer common questions and support your team with tools built around approved business information.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$799+<!-- --> · <!-- -->one-time website assistant setup</p><h3><a href=\"/services/ai-solutions\">AI Solutions for Small Businesses</a></h3><p>AI website assistants and scoped business tools that help answer common questions and support everyday work with human oversight.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/ai-solutions\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><section class=\"service-category\" id=\"website-care\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>Website care &amp; performance</h2><p>Keep your online presence useful, current, and ready for customers after launch.</p></div><div class=\"service-catalog\"><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">$99–$499<!-- --> · <!-- -->per month</p><h3><a href=\"/services/website-care\">Monthly Website Care &amp; Local Growth</a></h3><p>Defined monthly support for website maintenance, content updates, reporting, and local search improvements.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/website-care\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article><article><p class=\"eyebrow\">Custom quote<!-- --> · <!-- -->based on platform and scope</p><h3><a href=\"/services/hosting-performance\">Hosting &amp; Website Performance</a></h3><p>Hosting setup, website migration, and performance improvements for businesses that need a reliable, responsive online presence.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/services/hosting-performance\">See scope &amp; details ↗</a></article></div></section><div class=\"care-row\"><p>Not sure where to start? Tell me what is taking time or costing you inquiries. Your free review gives you a practical starting point and a recommendation.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"/#contact\">Request your free review ↗</a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"wrap footer\"><a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\">the sip<span>WEB STUDIO</span></a><p>Thoughtfully built in Mississippi.<br/><a href=\"/services\">Explore services</a> · <a href=\"/services/google-business-profile#disclosure\">Google profile disclosure</a></p><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> The Sip Web Studio</p></footer><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com/#studio\",\"name\":\"The Sip Web Studio\",\"url\":\"https://thesipwebstudio.com\",\"email\":\"thesipsoftwaresolutions@gmail.com\",\"areaServed\":[\"Jackson, Mississippi\",\"Ridgeland, Mississippi\",\"Madison, Mississippi\",\"Flowood, Mississippi\",\"Brandon, Mississippi\",\"Pearl, Mississippi\",\"Clinton, Mississippi\"],\"description\":\"Independent website and business technology studio serving Jackson and Mississippi businesses.\",\"hasOfferCatalog\":{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Small business technology services\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Web design and development\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Local SEO\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Website maintenance\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Hosting\"},{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":\"Go